output/

# go test -c output
*.test

# Server binaries. script/build.sh writes them into output/bin/ (covered by
# output/ above); these guard the ones a manual
# `go build -o <name> ./frameworks/<name>` drops at the repository root - a
# 12MB greatws executable reached main that way.
/fio
/fio_event
# The names the entries above were built under before the greatws -> fio
# rename; a stray binary from an older checkout is the same accident.
/greatws
/greatws_event
